  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this $1.5m WFP project is to enable flood-affected people to meet their essential food needs during the critical flood period. WFP will provide cash transfers for 31,472 people in Tandjile, Logone Occidental and Mandoul provinces for 3 months. Among the 31,472 people targeted will be 7,443 women and 9,867 girls.</narrative>
  </description>
